<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="45cb0bde">&lt;p&gt;
    The testing team will support the hot fix efforts by validating the fixes in the lower test environments and supporting
    regression testing.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Following the implementation of a hot fix, a quick or condensed regression test is performed to verify the fix hasn’t
    affected any other functionality. After this regression test is performed, the fix will be moved to the production
    environment for business or end user testing and sign off.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="8e70c25d"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="47607f74"></attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="12eb264c"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="64b64c20">To validate the critical defect fixes in the lower environments for the defects identified in production environment. This
validation along with necessary regression will be performed prior to production deployment of the fixes.</attribute>
<attribute name="alternatives" nodeId="d69b6677"></attribute>
